1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,375
IT company mein chhantni ho gayi. Ab kya karun?

2
00:00:03,675 --> 00:00:09,565
Shreya, bachchon ko coding aur robotics sikha! Aane wala zamaana isi ka hai!

3
00:00:09,865 --> 00:00:12,460
Dadaji, chhote bachche coding seekhenge?

4
00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:17,421
Khel-khel mein! Paanch laptop aur robot kit, lagbhag 2 lakh.

5
00:00:17,721 --> 00:00:24,637
Weekend pe free workshop kar. Bachche ne robot chalaya, to maa-baap khud admission karayenge.

6
00:00:25,187 --> 00:00:29,372
Madam, mera beta din bhar game khelta hai. Use game banana sikha do!

7
00:00:29,672 --> 00:00:34,660
Hafte mein teen class, 2 hazaar mahina. Teen mahine mein apna game banayega!

8
00:00:34,960 --> 00:00:37,995
Tees bachche, yaani mahine ke 60 hazaar.

9
00:00:38,295 --> 00:00:43,400
Phir schoolon se tie-up kar, wahan lab chala. Ek school, saikdon bachche!

10
00:00:43,700 --> 00:00:46,801
Naukri gayi, startup aaya! Shreya ki life set!
